                    │     M_dyn = Σ P(class_i)       │
                    │     i ∈ {car, ped, bicycle...} │
                    │  3. 静态 mask:                  │
                    │     M_sta = 1 - M_dyn          │
                    │  4. 投影到 BEV 空间              │
